  "title": "TALESonBET Star Johnell Young Will Be Featured in NBA 2k20",
  "htmlContent": "[caption id=\"attachment_507885\" align=\"aligncenter\" width=\"400\"]<img class=\"wp-image-507885 size-full\" src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/JohnellYoung2019BETSocialAwardsTylerjsE0Qp3gtkLl.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"600\" /> Getty Images[/caption]\n\n<iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/IEmQFIKTKlc\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe>\n\nLast week, 2K Sports released the <a href=\"https://landonbuford.com/actress-lara-heller-to-be-featured-in-nba-2k20/\">official trailer for NBA 2k20</a>, My Player mode. The visual was directed by Sheldon Candis, who directed Baltimore Boys, which is part of the ESPN 30 for 30 series. In the trailer, Idris Elba, Rosario Dawson, and Thomas Middleditch will play a coach, an agent, and an advisor.\n\nNBA 2K20 will be executively produced by Springhill Entertainment, which is owned by Maverick Carter and LeBron James. Others that were featured in the trailer are Mark Cuban, Ernie Hudson, Lamorne Morris, and Scottie Pippen. NBA 2k20 is scheduled to drop on September 6th.\n<blockquote class=\"instagram-media\" style=\"background: #FFF; border: 0; border-radius: 3px; box-shadow: 0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width: 540px; min-width: 326px; padding: 0; width: calc(100% - 2px);\" data-instgrm-captioned=\"\" data-instgrm-permalink=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/B1kAO1lnZ1f/\" data-instgrm-version=\"12\">\n<div style=\"padding: 16px;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 40px; margin-right: 14px; width: 40px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 100px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 60px;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 19% 0;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: block; height: 50px; margin: 0 auto 12px; width: 50px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"padding-top: 8px;\">\n<div style=\"color: #3897f0; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 550; line-height: 18px;\">View this post on Instagram</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 12.5% 0;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; margin-bottom: 14px; align-items: center;\">\n<div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(0px) translateY(7px);\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; height: 12.5px; transform: rotate(-45deg) translateX(3px) translateY(1px); width: 12.5px; flex-grow: 0; margin-right: 14px; margin-left: 2px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(9px) translateY(-18px);\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-left: 8px;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 20px; width: 20px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 2px solid transparent; border-left: 6px solid #f4f4f4; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; transform: translateX(16px) translateY(-4px) rotate(30deg);\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-left: auto;\">\n<div style=\"width: 0px; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-right: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(16px);\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; flex-grow: 0; height: 12px; width: 16px; transform: translateY(-4px);\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-left: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(-4px) translateX(8px);\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; padding: 0 4px;\"><a style=\"color: #000; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; line-height: 17px; text-decoration: none; word-wrap: break-word;\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/B1kAO1lnZ1f/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Make sure y’all go pre-order that @nba2k dropping Sept6th. Ladies on behalf of ya boyfriends I apologize lol #BertieBarnett #2k20 #nba2k20 #myplayer</a></p>\n<p style=\"color: #c9c8cd; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 17px; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 8px; overflow: hidden; padding: 8px 0 7px; text-align: center; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;\">A post shared by <a style=\"color: #c9c8cd; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; line-height: 17px;\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/johnellxyoung/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Johnell Young</a> (@johnellxyoung) on <time style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 17px;\" datetime=\"2019-08-24T21:59:15+00:00\">Aug 24, 2019 at 2:59pm PDT</time></p>\n\n</div></blockquote>\n<script async=\"\" src=\"//www.instagram.com/embed.js\"></script>\n\nEarlier today, Johnell Young, who plays “Gza” in WuTang: American Saga on Hulu, Woody on BET's Tales, and played Ray Luv in the All Eyez on Me movie. Announced that he would be featured in NBA 2K20 on Instagram. He will play a character by name of Bertie Barnett in the game.\n\nYoung does have a background in basketball back in May of 2017 during an<a href=\"https://www.thehypemagazine.com/2017/05/all-eyez-on-me-star-johnell-young-talks-biopic-and-nba-ambitions/\"> interview with The Hype Magazine</a>. He shared with me that he was preparing for a tryout with the New York Knicks. He was looking to land a spot with their G-League team at the time.\n\nHe shared that he would like to play against the likes of Kyrie Irving and LeBron James one day.\n\nCleveland and Kyrie Irving is my favorite player. That team is to stack and all their players complement each other very well Lebron, JR. Smith and Kevin Love and the comradery of that team are just great and I love it. One day I hope I will get that opportunity to compete with competitors like them. I know it won’t happen to on my time, but on god’s time and I’m just practicing and making sure I’m ready for when that time comes.\n\nJohnell wasn't the only actor to announces that he would be apart of this year's installment. Actress Lara Heller also announced via Instagram that she would be featured in the game as well.\n<blockquote class=\"instagram-media\" style=\"background: #FFF; border: 0; border-radius: 3px; box-shadow: 0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width: 540px; min-width: 326px; padding: 0; width: calc(100% - 2px);\" data-instgrm-captioned=\"\" data-instgrm-permalink=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/B1ZoYY1pOrE/\" data-instgrm-version=\"12\">\n<div style=\"padding: 16px;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 40px; margin-right: 14px; width: 40px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 100px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 60px;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 19% 0;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: block; height: 50px; margin: 0 auto 12px; width: 50px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"padding-top: 8px;\">\n<div style=\"color: #3897f0; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 550; line-height: 18px;\">View this post on Instagram</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 12.5% 0;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; margin-bottom: 14px; align-items: center;\">\n<div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(0px) translateY(7px);\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; height: 12.5px; transform: rotate(-45deg) translateX(3px) translateY(1px); width: 12.5px; flex-grow: 0; margin-right: 14px; margin-left: 2px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(9px) translateY(-18px);\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-left: 8px;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 20px; width: 20px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 2px solid transparent; border-left: 6px solid #f4f4f4; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; transform: translateX(16px) translateY(-4px) rotate(30deg);\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-left: auto;\">\n<div style=\"width: 0px; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-right: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(16px);\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; flex-grow: 0; height: 12px; width: 16px; transform: translateY(-4px);\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-left: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(-4px) translateX(8px);\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; padding: 0 4px;\"><a style=\"color: #000; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; line-height: 17px; text-decoration: none; word-wrap: break-word;\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/B1ZoYY1pOrE/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Loved being a part of this epic game @nba2k Big hug to @2k @sheldoncandis @tombini @dericaugustine  Excited to play it now! Scroll for trailer  @springhillent @kingjames @mavcarter ⛹ ‍♂️#nba2k #2k #basketball #videogames #gaming #playstation #nintendo #xbox</a></p>\n<p style=\"color: #c9c8cd; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 17px; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 8px; overflow: hidden; padding: 8px 0 7px; text-align: center; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;\">A post shared by <a style=\"color: #c9c8cd; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; line-height: 17px;\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/laraheller/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> LaraHeller</a> (@laraheller) on <time style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 17px;\" datetime=\"2019-08-20T21:14:00+00:00\">Aug 20, 2019 at 2:14pm PDT</time></p>\n\n</div></blockquote>\n<script async=\"\" src=\"//www.instagram.com/embed.js\"></script>\n\nHeller is known for her roles in movies such as Breaking the Bank, Troy the Odyssey, and her upcoming project Synth.  Back in May of this year, Heller shared with me that she just finished working on a video game, but couldn't release any details at the time.\n<blockquote>I just shot a video game, which will be out in September. I just shot a film called Always A Bridesmaid, and I play a French character called Lily. That was also a fun film to be a part of for me.</blockquote>",
